#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Albums View"
msgstr "Vista de álbums"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:10
#, no-c-format
msgid "By clicking the <quote>Albums</quote> button on the left side bar you toggle the <quote>Albums</quote> tree which provides an organized view of your photograph albums. The top item <quote>Albums</quote> just shows the <quote>welcome to &digikam;</quote> screen in the view area. The next level of the <quote>Albums</quote> tree shows your different Collections (marked by the <inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"&path;using-mainwindow-icon-collection.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject> icon) or at least one if you haven't added one or more yet in the <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure &digikam;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> Collections section. Each Collection represents a folder branch on your hard disk, on removable media or on network shares and the next levels in the tree show the structure of those folders, here called <quote>Albums</quote>. The albums can be sorted by their folder layout on the hard disk, by the Category that has been set in the <link linkend=\"albumpropsedit.anchor\">Album Properties</link> or by the Date of that Albums (this date can also be changed in the Properties of each Album). You can invert the sort order (ascending/descending) by clicking on the title bar of the album tree."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can switch between these sort orders using <guimenuitem>Sort Albums</guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>View</guimenu> menu."
msgstr "Pódese cambiar entre estas ordes de ordenación usando <guimenuitem>Ordenar os álbums</guimenuitem> no menú <guimenu>Vista</guimenu>."

#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a New Album"
msgstr "Crear un álbum novo"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:21
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "There are a number of ways to create a new Album. You can create a new Album when you upload new photographs from the Camera using the Camera Tool. You can also create a new empty Album by clicking the <guibutton>New</guibutton> button on the tool bar. As an additional option, you can create a new Album by importing an existing folder of photographs from your computer; just select <menuchoice><guimenu>Import</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Add Folders...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the menu bar and select the folder that you want to import. An Album will be created with the same name as the hard disk folder. You can use drag and drop to import a folder. Drag a folder icon, for example from a &konqueror; window. Then drop it on the album list on the left. A menu will appear that gives you the option to move or copy the folder into &digikam;."
msgid "There are a number of ways to create a new Album. You can create a new Album when you upload new photographs from the Camera using <menuchoice><guimenu>Import</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Cameras</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. You can also create a new empty Album with <menuchoice><guimenu>Album</guimenu> <guimenuitem>New...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> (<keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo>) in the <quote>Albums</quote> view. As an additional option, you can create a new Album by importing an existing folder of photographs from your computer; just select <menuchoice><guimenu>Import</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Add Folders...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the menu bar and select the folder that you want to import. An Album will be created with the same name as the hard disk folder. You can use drag and drop to import a folder. Drag a folder icon, for example from a &dolphin; window. Then drop it on the album list on the left. A menu will appear that gives you the option to move or copy the folder into &digikam;."
msgstr "Os álbums pódense crear de moitas maneiras. Pódese crear un novo ao engadir fotografías novas desde a cámara usando a ferramenta Cámara. Tamén se pode crear un álbum baleiro novo premendo o botón <guibutton>Novo</guibutton> da barra de ferramentas. Como opción adicional, pódese crear un álbum novo importando un cartafol de fotografías existente no computador; abonda con escoller <menuchoice><guimenu>Importar</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Engadir cartafoles…</guimenuitem></menuchoice> na barra de menú e escoller o cartafol que se queira importar. Créase un álbum co mesmo nome que o cartafol do disco duro. Pódese usar arrastrar e soltar para importar un cartafol. Arrastre a icona dun cartafol, por exemplo nunha xanela do &konqueror;. Sólteo sobre a lista de cartafoles da esquerda. Aparece un menú que dá a opción de mover ou copiar o cartafol ao &digikam;."

#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid "Deleting an Album"
msgstr "Eliminar un álbum"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:30
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "When you delete an Album from &digikam; it will be moved into the &kde; Trash Can. As an option you could change this behavior, so that delete really did remove the Album and all of the photographs in it. This can be changed by selecting <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &digikam;</guimenuitem></menuchoice> and selecting the Miscellaneous page. At the top of this page are the settings that control what happens when a photograph is deleted. To delete an Album right-click the Album in the &quot;Albums&quot; tree and select Delete Album from Hard Disk from the context menu."
msgid "When you delete an Album from &digikam; it will be moved into the internal Trash Can. As an option you could change this behavior, so that delete really will remove the Album and all of the photographs in it. This can be changed by selecting <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &digikam;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> and selecting the Miscellaneous page. At the top of this page are the settings that control what happens when a photograph is deleted. To delete an Album, click with the &RMB; over the Album in the <quote>Albums</quote> tree and select Delete Album from the context menu."
msgstr "Cando se elimina un álbum do &digikam;, este móvese para o lixo de &kde;. Como opción, pódese cambiar este comportamento de xeito que liminar o álbum realmente retire o álbum e todas as fotografías que conteña. Isto pódese cambiar escollendo <menuchoice><guimenu>Configuración</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configurar &digikam;</guimenuitem></menuchoice> e escollendo a páxina Diversos. Na parte superior desta páxina están as opcións que controlan o que acontece cando se elimina unha fotografía. Para eliminar un álbum prema co botón dereito do rato o álbum na árbore &quot;álbums&quot; e escolla Eliminar o álbum do disco no menú de contexto."

#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding a Photograph to an Album"
msgstr "Engadir unha fotografía a un álbum"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:39
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Most of the time you will create new Albums and populate them with photographs directly from your camera using the Camera Tool. However, sometimes you may want to add a photograph that you already have on your computer to an existing Album. To add a photograph to an Album, make sure that the Album is selected. Then, either click the <guilabel>Add Images</guilabel> icon in the tool bar or select <menuchoice><guimenu>Import</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Add Images...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the menu bar. Select the photographs that you want to add from the file dialog and click <guilabel>Open</guilabel>. The photographs will be copied into the Album. Additionally, you can use drag and drop to import photographs. Drag the photographs icons, for example from a &konqueror; window. Then drop it on the image list on the right hand side."
msgid "Most of the time you will create new Albums and populate them with photographs directly from your camera using the Camera Tool. However, sometimes you may want to add a photograph that you already have on your computer to an existing Album. To add a photograph to an Album select <menuchoice><guimenu>Import</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Add Images...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> (<keycombo>&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>I</keycap></keycombo>) from the menu bar. Select a source folder from the dialog and click OK. An import window will open. Select the photographs that you want to add and choose <guilabel>Download Selected</guilabel> from the <quote>Download</quote> drop down menu. A dialog will open where you can choose the destination album. The photographs will be copied into the Album. <guilabel>Download New</guilabel> (<keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo>) from the same menu will copy only those images which are not in the destination folder yet."
msgstr "A maioría das veces vai crear álbums novos e enchelos con fotografías directamente desde a cámara usando a ferramenta Cámara. Porén, ás veces pode desexar engadir unha fotografía que xa teña no computador a un álbum existente. Para engadir unha fotografía a un álbum, asegúrese de que escolleu Álbum. A seguir, prema a icona <guilabel>Engadir imaxes</guilabel> da barra de ferramentas ou escolla <menuchoice><guimenu>Importar</guimenu><guimenuitem>Engadir imaxes…</guimenuitem></menuchoice> da barra de menú. Escolla as fotografías que queira engadir no diálogo de ficheiros e prema <guilabel>Abrir</guilabel>. As fotografías cópianse ao álbum. Ademais disto, tamén pode usar o arrastrar e soltar para importar fotografías. Arrastre as iconas das fotografías, por exemplo desde unha xanela do &konqueror;. Sólteas sobre a lista de imaxes do lado dereito."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "Additionally, you can use drag and drop to import photographs. Drag the photographs icons, for example from a &dolphin; window. Then drop it on the image list on the right hand side."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid "If you have a scanner configured, you can also scan a photograph straight into an Album. Select <menuchoice><guimenu>Import</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Import from Scanner...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr "Se ten un escáner configurado, tamén pode escanear unha fotografía directamente para un álbum. escolla <menuchoice><guimenu>Importar</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Importar dun escáner…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "Moving or Copying Photographs Between Albums"
msgstr "Mover ou copiar fotografías entre álbums"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid "Simply drag the photograph and drop it on the destination Album to move or copy it from one Album to another. A menu will appear that gives you the option to <guilabel>Move</guilabel> or <guilabel>Copy</guilabel> the photograph. You can move or copy multiple photographs the same way, just select all the photographs that you want to move and drag them on to the destination Album."
msgstr "Simplemente arrastre a fotografía e sóltea sobre o álbum de destino para movela ou copiala dun álbum para outro. Aparece un menú que dá a opción de <guilabel>Mover</guilabel> ou <guilabel>Copiar</guilabel> a fotografía. Pódense mover ou copiar varias fotografías da mesma maneira; simplemente escolla todas as fotografías que queira mover e arrástreas para o álbum de destino."

#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "Managing Albums"
msgstr "Xestión dos álbums"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:69
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "An Album contains a set of photographs. Album Properties allows you to set information about this set. To access the Album Properties right-click on an Album and select <guilabel>Edit Album Properties</guilabel> from the context menu."
msgid "Album Properties can help you remember which kind of photographs are in an Album and can also help you to organize the <quote>Albums</quote> tree. To access the Album Properties, click with the &RMB; on an Album and select <guilabel>Properties</guilabel> (<keycombo>&Alt;&Enter;</keycombo>) from the context menu."
msgstr "Un álbum contén un conxunto de fotografías. As Propiedades do álbum permite configurar a información sobre ese conxunto. Para acceder ás propiedades do álbum, prema un álbum co botón dereito do rato e escolla <guilabel>Editar as propiedades do álbum</guilabel> no menú de contexto."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Album Properties dialog allows you to set:"
msgstr "O diálogo Propiedades do álbum permite configurar:"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Album <guilabel>Title</guilabel> : Name of the Album, identical with the name of the folder on your hard disk. If you edit it here, the folder will also be renamed."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:86
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "The Album <guilabel>Collection</guilabel> : this is a way of grouping your Albums together by a common label. The Collection you set will be used to order your albums when you select <guilabel>By Collection</guilabel> from the drop down box in the tool bar or using <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Sort Albums</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>By Collection</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. If you want to add and delete Collection labels, use the <link linkend=\"setup-collection\">Collection Settings</link> dialog."
msgid "The Album <guilabel>Category</guilabel> : this is a way of grouping your Albums together by a common label. The Category you set will be used to order your albums when you select <guilabel>By Category</guilabel> from the drop down box in the tool bar or using <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Sort Albums</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>By Category</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. If you want to add and delete Category labels, choose from the menu <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &digikam;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> and here the Album Category section."
msgstr "A <guilabel>colección</guilabel> do álbum: esta é unha maneira de agrupar os álbums cunha etiqueta común. A colección que se indique úsase para ordenar os álbums cando se escolla <guilabel>Por colección</guilabel> no menú despregábel da barra de ferramentas ou usando <menuchoice><guimenu>Vista</guimenu><guimenuitem>Ordenar os álbums</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Por colección</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Se quere engadir e eliminar etiquetas de colección, use o diálogo <link linkend=\"setup-collection\">Configuración das coleccións</link>."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:89
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "The <guilabel>Comments</guilabel> for the Album : this will be shown in the banner at the top of the main Image Window."
msgid "The <guilabel>Caption</guilabel> for the Album : Usually a short description of the content, but of course you are free to abuse it in any conceivable way. But beware: this will be shown in the banner at the top of the main Image Window ;-)"
msgstr "Os <guilabel>comentarios</guilabel> do álbum: isto aparece nun texto na parte superior da xanela principal de imaxes."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Album <guilabel>Date</guilabel> : this will be used when you order your Albums by date using <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Sort Albums</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>By Date</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr "A <guilabel>Data do álbum</guilabel>: isto úsase para ordenar os álbums por data usando <menuchoice><guimenu>Vista</guimenu><guimenuitem>Ordenar os álbums</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Por data</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Oldest, Average, Newest</guilabel> buttons : these will set the <guilabel>Date</guilabel> to the oldest, average or latest date of the images in that album. It will first try to calculate the average date of the images in the album based on the EXIF-headers. If that fails it will fall back to the modification date of the files in that folder."
msgstr "Botóns <guilabel>A máis vella, Media, A máis nova</guilabel>: con estes configúrase a data como a máis vella, a media ou a máis nova das datas das imaxes do álbum. Intenta calcular primeiro a data media das imaxes do álbum baseándose nas cabeceiras EXIF. Se isto falla, recorre á data de modificación dos ficheiros do cartafol."

#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "Setting the Album Icon"
msgstr "Configuración da icona do álbum"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid "&digikam; displays the usual folder icon in the <quote>Albums</quote> list. You can choose one of your photographs instead. This may help you to remember what kind of photographs are contained in an Album."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:109
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "To select a different photograph as the Album icon, right-click on the photograph that you want to use as the Album icon and select &quot;Set as Album Thumbnail&quot; from the context menu. Additionally you can use drag and drop to set the Album icon. Drag the photographs icon and drop it on the currently selected Album in the Album list."
msgid "To select a photograph as the Album icon, click with the &RMB; on the photograph that you want to use as the Album icon and select <guimenuitem>Set as Album Thumbnail</guimenuitem> from the context menu. Additionally you can use drag and drop to set the Album icon. Drag the photographs icon from the thumbnail area and drop it on the currently selected Album in the Album list."
msgstr "Para escoller unha fotografía diferente como icona do álbum, prema a fotografía que queira usar como icona do álbum co botón dereito do álbum e escolla &quot;Definir como miniatura do álbum&quot; no menú de contexto. tamén pode usar arrastrar e soltar para configurar a icona do álbum. Arrastre a icona da fotografía e sóltea sobre o álbum escollido na lista de álbums."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid "An Album can only be in one Album Collection and Album Collections cannot be nested."
msgstr "Un álbum só pode estar nunha colección de álbums e as coleccións de álbums non se poden aniñar."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5
#: using-mainwindow-albumsview.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "&digikam; also supports tagging individual photographs. Album Categories are different from photograph tagging because the Album Category applies to all the photographs in an Album rather than to individual photographs. You can use both Album Category and tagging to organize your photographs."
msgstr ""
